WEBVTT

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:25.760
[Tablet of Beloved Brother Song Jie]

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:03.970
Ms. Zhang.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.780
Mai is still investigating Xu Li's case.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.610
Just let him investigate it.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:13.640
Everything that needed to be cleaned up
has been taken care of.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:14.710
How much harm

00:01:15.039 --> 00:01:16.500
can an ex-con possibly do?

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:43.070
[The Punishment]

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:45.230
[Punish those who commit crimes and make mistakes so as to discipline them,
and execute those who violate the prohibitions so as to terrify would-be violators.]

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:47.130
[Guanzi – On Laws and Standards]

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:50.560
[Episode 24]
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.030
Mr. Liu,

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.280
do you remember this place?

00:03:18.079 --> 00:03:21.470
I gave you a chance. You wouldn't listen,
but insisted on going against me.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.000
I have no choice
but to take my anger out on you.

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:26.920
After all the twists and turns,

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.850
we've circled back to where we began.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:32.430
Back then,

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:33.970
you killed Ma Jin

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:35.470
right here, didn't you?

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:38.360
Look,

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.430
maybe you should die here too.
What do you think?

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:42.000
No.

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:45.310
I'm not the same person I was
two years ago.

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:46.460
But to us,

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:47.940
you're still the same.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:06.500
Okay.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:12.430
Why did Qiao Defu's wife

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:15.050
suddenly want to do business with me?

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:29.590
I guess she wants to tell you

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:32.000
that Mr. Qiao is selling his company,

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:34.190
and I'm the one taking it over.

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:38.190
What did you do to Qiao Defu?

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:39.760
I didn't do anything.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.510
I only advised him

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:42.890
to turn himself in.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:43.909
But I promised

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.050
to let him live a good life
after he gets out of prison.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:49.820
And I'm willing to take over his company.

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:51.150
I'm not like Mr. Qiao.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:53.010
We can make money together.

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:55.080
Ms. Zhang, if you're interested,

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:56.520
you can also invest.

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:58.680
Liu Tianye,

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:01.160
do you think you can get
a seat at the table

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.090
just because you have his company?

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:06.050
I can make you disappear right now.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.170
You won't kill me.

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.760
I have Qiao Defu's company now.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.110
If I'm gone,

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.200
you won't be able
to run the port business.

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:17.000
Instead of all the threats and hostility,

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.120
why don't we calm down

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:19.180
and talk business?

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:20.120
I know

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:22.750
He Biao and He Gang
have drawn the attention of the police,

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.810
and you won't work with them anymore.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.170
Why not consider me?

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:27.780
If you work with me,

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:30.000
you won't have to stand in the spotlight

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.130
because I'll take care of everything.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:35.600
But your brother is pursuing this case
so relentlessly.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:38.159
He's been trying to find
the people behind me.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.970
Even if I agree to work with you,

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.480
now that a businessman has been kidnapped,

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.350
will he really

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:44.870
let it go?

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:47.610
If you want a seat at the table,

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:50.100
you have to be completely clean.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.120
I know Qin Feng very well.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:54.540
I'll deal with him.

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:55.480
Ms. Zhang,

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.930
you and your friends can rest assured.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.380
What about Su Hongbao?

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:01.510
He works for me.

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:04.120
He's a serious repeat offender,

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:04.950
and

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:07.840
he knows too much about us.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.160
If necessary,

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.640
I'll do what needs to be done.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.890
If your people can't handle it,

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.950
mine will step in and take care of it.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:19.120
You have to clean up your mess

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:20.520
and wash your hands clean

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.970
before you can think about
having a seat at the table.

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:46.360
[Longwan Logistics Co., Ltd.]

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:46.890
Hongbao,

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:48.630
let him go.

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:52.300
Do as I say.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:06:59.159
Who is it?

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.400
Uncle Tianye.

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:03.330
What's the matter?

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:14.930
I'm sorry, Uncle Tianye. I...

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:16.460
I failed in my duty.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:19.230
It's okay.

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:20.650
Don't blame yourself.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:23.840
Uncle Tianye,

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.910
maybe you should find
someone else to do it.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:28.020
I'm worried

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.690
that I'm not capable enough.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:48.080
Not capable enough?

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.159
How capable do you have to be?

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:52.020
Come on.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:52.950
Have a sip.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:00.920
How is it?

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:04.880
It's good tea.

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.730
Drink more, and you'll understand.

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:09.740
Have some peanuts.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:13.430
Do you know

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:14.960
why I chose you as my driver?

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:17.720
No.

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:23.000
When I first saw you,

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:23.910
I felt

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:26.620
that you were just like me in the past.

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:27.560
Back when

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.770
Ma Jin treated us like dirt,

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:31.830
I was also scared,

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:32.880
just like you.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:34.909
Later on,

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:36.890
I realized something.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:40.240
Do you know
what the fairest thing in the world is?

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.929
When a bullet hits someone, they bleed.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:44.270
Everyone bleeds.

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:46.090
Don't fear others.

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:48.410
You're no worse than anyone else, right?

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:49.550
Just remember,

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:51.520
you're from Longwan,

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:52.360
and fate

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:54.060
can be changed.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.970
The way to change your fate

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:58.610
is to force yourself

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:00.490
to face the things you fear.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:02.780
Got it?

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:05.360
Got it.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.750
Finish your tea and go home.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.350
Your girl is waiting for you.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:28.590
Uncle Tianye.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:31.270
Thanks.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.090
I prepared

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:04.050
these clothes for you long ago.

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:07.150
They fit you.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.080
My brother has grown up.

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:16.120
He's matured now.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:31.600
Muzhi.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.190
All these years,

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.340
my life

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.820
has been

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:42.910
a mess.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.080
It's taken me

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.060
so long to figure some things out.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.290
What do you mean?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:54.600
Sit down, Muzhi.

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:04.030
Muzhi,

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.270
the police are also looking for Su Hongbao

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:08.120
and Qiao Defu.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:10.280
But the point is

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.500
why Zhang Xin hasn't made a move,

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:14.630
and even Liu Tianye
hasn't told us to take action.

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:16.360
They don't seem worried at all.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.510
Zhang Xin has made her choice.

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:20.350
That's right.

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:23.220
They're on the same side now,

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:24.880
and we've been abandoned.

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:29.930
Muzhi,

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.640
we have no choice but to go all in.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.460
Whether we succeed or not,

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:36.290
we have to fire the gun.

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:39.220
Only by escalating the situation

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.360
can we drag everyone else down.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.250
No one can take away

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:55.330
what belongs to us.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:59.680
Nobody knows
who'll get the seat in the end.

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:43.480
Put on some warm clothes.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:45.450
I'll take you home.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.720
Will you throw away my phone or not?

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:54.510
You won't?

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:59.380
Find someone to teach me calligraphy
after you go back.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:23.340
I asked around.

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.120
There's a deserted
factory area over there.

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:25.990
It's empty.

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:27.650
They might be hiding there.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:33.820
Come on. Get in the car.

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:54.750
[Hailin Wood Processing Factory]

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:10.380
[Hailin Wood Processing Factory]

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.030
Here?

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:41.150
Bian Jing,

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:42.450
wait here with Wen Bo.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:43.670
Okay.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:07.880
We must take him down today!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:08.550
Yes!

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:16.270
Bro.

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:17.000
The police!

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:18.270
Go!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.720
Get down!

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.390
Move!

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:39.500
What's wrong with you?

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:41.810
Have you lost your mind?

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.360
What are you doing here?

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:44.930
What did you do to Qiao Defu?

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:47.840
Speak up! What did you do?

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:49.770
Let's talk over there.

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:52.830
If you go back there again,
you won't be able to get out.

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:53.890
Do you understand?

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:55.740
Go back where?

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:58.270
I'd rather die than go back in there.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:18:58.830
Go back?

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:02.030
Qiao Defu is fine.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:04.160
He's probably home
with his wife right now.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.960
If you don't believe me, just ask him.
He's really fine.

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:08.550
You do whatever they tell you to do,

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:08.960
huh?

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.290
What's in it for you?

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:13.240
Do you pay me?

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.200
Su, I'm afraid you might not
live long enough

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.730
to spend the money you earn.

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:19.400
You know exactly

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.480
what you are to them, right?

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:23.230
You do all the dirty work.

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.670
When things go wrong, you take the blame.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.310
They're using you.

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:29.440
Don't you know that?

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.080
You always talk about death.

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:35.030
If you're gone, what about your brothers?

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.030
Have you thought about that?

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:36.630
Enough.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:38.610
I know everything.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:41.950
Everyone has their own fate.

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:44.580
I just do what I can do.

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:47.220
Su, please stop.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:51.360
Times have changed.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:53.790
This isn't the era where you can get ahead

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:56.120
just by throwing punches and being loyal.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:04.680
Mai.

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:06.830
Listen.

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:09.310
In a few days,

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.310
after I take care of another matter,

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:14.160
I'm afraid

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.460
I'll have to leave.

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:17.160
Don't worry about the money.

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.120
Once I get settled there,

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:20.800
if you're willing,

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:22.920
I'll send someone to get you.

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:24.180
We can leave together.

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:26.450
We'll get out of this place.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.130
Still another matter?

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:32.410
You just won't listen to me, right?

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:35.280
You really want to end up in jail,
don't you?

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:37.920
Fine.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.170
No more matters.

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:43.440
Let's

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:45.090
leave together.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:47.200
Su.

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:50.640
I've said what I had to say

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:53.830
and given all the advice I could.

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:56.090
As for which path to go,

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:58.030
it's your own choice.

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:41.270
It's you!

00:22:52.310 --> 00:22:53.160
Su!

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:08.010
Su, are you okay?

00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:09.210
Be careful.

00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:47.720
Crazy,

00:23:48.160 --> 00:23:49.550
get him! Hurry!

00:23:50.480 --> 00:23:51.210
Who did this?

00:23:51.310 --> 00:23:52.480
The person in the portrait!

00:23:52.480 --> 00:23:53.410
He went that way!

00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:54.400
Is he okay?

00:23:58.960 --> 00:23:59.880
Call an ambulance!

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:01.060
Lock down this area!

00:24:01.550 --> 00:24:02.070
Wen Bo!

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:02.640
Get up.

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:04.810
Is this the emergency center?

00:24:04.810 --> 00:24:08.030
[Public Security]

00:24:36.350 --> 00:24:37.210
Do you remember

00:24:37.550 --> 00:24:38.550
what to say later?

00:24:39.680 --> 00:24:40.980
It was all Su Hongbao.

00:24:42.310 --> 00:24:43.240
Su Hongbao did it all.

00:24:43.240 --> 00:24:44.090
Louder.

00:24:45.550 --> 00:24:46.750
It was all Su Hongbao.

00:24:47.550 --> 00:24:49.110
Su Hongbao did it all.

00:24:50.640 --> 00:24:52.700
Just blame everything on Su Hongbao.

00:24:52.750 --> 00:24:53.810
As for your family,

00:24:53.960 --> 00:24:55.560
we'll take good care of them.

00:24:57.590 --> 00:24:58.200
Go.

00:25:41.440 --> 00:25:42.170
Well,

00:25:42.200 --> 00:25:43.510
Mentor heard you were injured,

00:25:43.510 --> 00:25:45.040
so he rushed over to see you.

00:25:45.240 --> 00:25:45.770
You know?

00:25:47.030 --> 00:25:48.430
Enough for useless talk.

00:25:48.480 --> 00:25:50.160
What about that person? Any news?

00:25:50.160 --> 00:25:51.560
We're searching for him.

00:25:51.920 --> 00:25:53.170
Didn't I tell you

00:25:54.110 --> 00:25:55.270
not to get him involved?

00:25:55.270 --> 00:25:56.920
How did this happen?

00:25:57.110 --> 00:25:58.280
They're my legs.

00:25:58.300 --> 00:25:58.880
I got myself injured,

00:25:58.880 --> 00:26:00.270
and I accept that. Don't blame others.

00:26:00.270 --> 00:26:01.600
Stop trying to be a hero, okay?

00:26:01.600 --> 00:26:02.530
You weak old man.

00:26:03.000 --> 00:26:03.720
If

00:26:03.830 --> 00:26:05.070
Qin Feng had been a moment later,

00:26:05.070 --> 00:26:06.240
you would've lost your life!

00:26:06.240 --> 00:26:07.500
Have you investigated Zhang Xin?

00:26:07.500 --> 00:26:08.300
Working on it.

00:26:08.590 --> 00:26:10.130
Rome wasn't built in a day.

00:26:10.160 --> 00:26:11.440
They're not stupid.

00:26:12.350 --> 00:26:13.470
Oh, Ye.

00:26:13.790 --> 00:26:15.080
You were full of this same empty talk

00:26:15.080 --> 00:26:16.350
ten years ago.

00:26:16.480 --> 00:26:17.590
What did I do ten years ago?

00:26:17.590 --> 00:26:19.030
You only talked big,
but never investigated cases!

00:26:19.030 --> 00:26:20.830
-How do you know I didn't investigate it?
-What did you do?

00:26:20.830 --> 00:26:22.590
-How do you know I didn't?
-I was the one who kept watch on him.

00:26:22.590 --> 00:26:23.720
Then investigate it!

00:26:23.720 --> 00:26:24.880
Just investigate it!
That's all you need to do!

00:26:24.880 --> 00:26:25.480
Okay.

00:26:25.790 --> 00:26:26.650
Don't be angry.

00:26:27.000 --> 00:26:27.650
Calm down.

00:26:28.590 --> 00:26:29.680
Didn't we agree to be nice?

00:26:29.680 --> 00:26:30.400
Just came to check on him.

00:26:30.400 --> 00:26:31.480
Mentor came all this way to see you.

00:26:31.480 --> 00:26:32.900
What is this all about?

00:26:33.510 --> 00:26:34.720
Want to argue with me?

00:26:34.920 --> 00:26:36.110
Wait until you can stand up first!

00:26:36.110 --> 00:26:36.750
Fine.

00:26:36.750 --> 00:26:37.420
Keep arguing.

00:26:37.420 --> 00:26:39.070
I can't stop you two. Just go ahead.

00:26:39.070 --> 00:26:40.150
Just take off your cast

00:26:40.150 --> 00:26:41.410
and fight with Mentor.

00:26:48.790 --> 00:26:49.640
Captain Qin,

00:26:49.720 --> 00:26:51.160
Qiao Defu turned himself in.

00:26:51.160 --> 00:26:52.820
He's at the Municipal Bureau.

00:26:54.680 --> 00:26:55.610
Alright, got it.

00:26:57.270 --> 00:26:58.070
What's wrong?

00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:00.970
Qiao Defu turned himself in.

00:27:02.200 --> 00:27:03.200
Then hurry back.

00:27:03.240 --> 00:27:04.790
If anything happens, call me right away.

00:27:04.790 --> 00:27:05.270
Quick.

00:27:07.180 --> 00:27:08.110
Keep fighting. It's fine.

00:27:08.110 --> 00:27:09.740
Just go! Hurry!

00:27:17.590 --> 00:27:19.750
I quit gambling once.

00:27:21.070 --> 00:27:23.870
I even thought about
cutting off my finger to quit.

00:27:24.550 --> 00:27:26.860
But once I sit at the gambling table

00:27:28.240 --> 00:27:29.630
and see those chips,

00:27:30.110 --> 00:27:31.570
I just can't walk away.

00:27:32.200 --> 00:27:34.110
I owe Su Hongbao so much money.

00:27:35.310 --> 00:27:36.370
To pay off my debts,

00:27:37.200 --> 00:27:38.860
I borrowed from many friends,

00:27:40.200 --> 00:27:41.660
robbing Peter to pay Paul,

00:27:42.270 --> 00:27:44.400
and the hole just kept getting bigger.

00:27:46.250 --> 00:27:48.300
Su Hongbao insisted I repay him

00:27:48.830 --> 00:27:50.090
the debt plus interest

00:27:50.160 --> 00:27:51.400
all at once.

00:27:51.920 --> 00:27:54.720
He asked me to use
the project funds to pay him back.

00:27:55.310 --> 00:27:57.240
It's hundreds of millions of yuan.

00:27:57.960 --> 00:27:59.260
If I used that money,

00:28:00.200 --> 00:28:02.590
it'd be a capital crime.

00:28:04.000 --> 00:28:05.400
So, I begged him and said,

00:28:07.830 --> 00:28:09.000
"Don't rush.

00:28:09.000 --> 00:28:10.750
Well, as long as I have the company,

00:28:10.750 --> 00:28:12.350
I can make money gradually."

00:28:12.640 --> 00:28:14.040
He said he couldn't wait,

00:28:15.200 --> 00:28:16.060
so he tied me up.

00:28:17.640 --> 00:28:19.070
He wouldn't let me eat or drink,

00:28:19.070 --> 00:28:20.470
forcing me to pay my debt.

00:28:21.440 --> 00:28:23.600
Then I thought, I'd rather

00:28:23.880 --> 00:28:24.620
go to jail

00:28:25.030 --> 00:28:26.560
than wait for him to kill me.

00:28:27.310 --> 00:28:28.840
So, when he was distracted,

00:28:28.920 --> 00:28:30.650
I escaped and turned myself in.

00:28:36.160 --> 00:28:37.420
How long did it take you

00:28:38.480 --> 00:28:39.610
to make up the story?

00:28:40.960 --> 00:28:42.350
Did you rehearse it in front of a mirror?

00:28:42.350 --> 00:28:43.750
No, it's true.

00:28:43.920 --> 00:28:45.030
That gold basin...

00:28:45.440 --> 00:28:47.110
I bought it for 400 thousand yuan.

00:28:47.110 --> 00:28:48.970
About this big, maybe a kilogram.

00:28:49.160 --> 00:28:51.420
It's worth more than 400 thousand yuan.

00:28:53.920 --> 00:28:55.560
I'm telling the truth.

00:28:55.830 --> 00:28:57.390
You owe him so much money,

00:28:58.070 --> 00:28:59.240
and he wants to kill you?

00:28:59.240 --> 00:29:00.970
He doesn't want the money back?

00:29:02.680 --> 00:29:03.960
He already tied you up.

00:29:04.680 --> 00:29:05.510
Look at yourself. Do you think

00:29:05.510 --> 00:29:07.840
you could slip away without him noticing?

00:29:08.790 --> 00:29:10.160
Are you crazy? Or is he crazy?

00:29:10.160 --> 00:29:11.360
If I can't pay it back,

00:29:11.590 --> 00:29:12.960
he'll definitely kill me.

00:29:12.960 --> 00:29:13.640
Enough.

00:29:13.720 --> 00:29:14.920
Let's put this aside.

00:29:15.640 --> 00:29:17.370
Do you know whose money you owe?

00:29:17.480 --> 00:29:18.610
Su Hongbao's money.

00:29:18.720 --> 00:29:19.680
Su Hongbao?

00:29:20.640 --> 00:29:23.300
Does Su Hongbao have
that much money to lend you?

00:29:28.440 --> 00:29:29.970
Can you figure it out or not?

00:29:31.750 --> 00:29:32.680
He Gang's money.

00:29:33.440 --> 00:29:34.370
He Gang's money?

00:29:35.350 --> 00:29:37.000
So, you know it's He Gang's money.

00:29:37.000 --> 00:29:38.240
I warned you long ago

00:29:38.590 --> 00:29:39.390
not to gamble,

00:29:39.880 --> 00:29:40.410
right?

00:29:40.640 --> 00:29:42.400
I went to your place
to tell you in person,

00:29:42.400 --> 00:29:43.800
but you wouldn't listen.

00:29:44.000 --> 00:29:45.480
Now that you're in trouble,

00:29:45.480 --> 00:29:46.220
you realize

00:29:46.550 --> 00:29:47.950
you have no other choice.

00:29:48.160 --> 00:29:49.480
I was too arrogant

00:29:50.200 --> 00:29:51.720
and rude to you.

00:29:52.680 --> 00:29:53.640
I apologize.

00:29:54.160 --> 00:29:55.570
So, the real situation is

00:29:55.960 --> 00:29:57.090
you owe

00:29:57.350 --> 00:29:58.340
He Gang money.

00:29:58.880 --> 00:29:59.570
He Gang

00:29:59.880 --> 00:30:00.740
sent Su Hongbao

00:30:01.310 --> 00:30:01.970
to find you.

00:30:02.310 --> 00:30:04.260
He didn't tie you up

00:30:04.640 --> 00:30:06.550
to collect the debt for He Gang,

00:30:06.920 --> 00:30:07.320
right?

00:30:10.480 --> 00:30:11.160
Then

00:30:12.640 --> 00:30:13.400
why?

00:30:13.880 --> 00:30:15.210
Why? I'm asking you.

00:30:17.920 --> 00:30:18.920
Think about it.

00:30:19.960 --> 00:30:21.240
Su Hongbao gave me

00:30:21.920 --> 00:30:23.770
such a hard time.

00:30:24.240 --> 00:30:26.300
My blood pressure kept fluctuating.

00:30:26.510 --> 00:30:27.510
And my blood sugar

00:30:27.880 --> 00:30:29.990
was so unstable.

00:30:30.110 --> 00:30:31.680
I've been in a fog these days,

00:30:31.680 --> 00:30:32.420
and I just...

00:30:33.040 --> 00:30:34.040
Well,

00:30:37.820 --> 00:30:39.280
I kept forgetting things.

00:30:41.920 --> 00:30:43.670
Did he mention anything about the project?

00:30:43.670 --> 00:30:45.420
I think he did...

00:30:45.680 --> 00:30:46.730
Did he?

00:30:50.510 --> 00:30:51.040
I forgot.

00:30:51.390 --> 00:30:52.260
Okay.

00:30:52.480 --> 00:30:53.820
Take your time to think.

00:30:54.270 --> 00:30:55.330
I'll give you time.

00:30:57.350 --> 00:31:00.280
Now, tell me about
your cooperation with Liu Tianye.

00:31:02.750 --> 00:31:03.500
Well,

00:31:03.960 --> 00:31:05.690
he wanted to cooperate with me,

00:31:06.000 --> 00:31:07.400
and I had my own plan.

00:31:07.400 --> 00:31:08.120
I wanted

00:31:09.110 --> 00:31:10.520
to get some money from him

00:31:10.590 --> 00:31:11.650
to pay off my debts.

00:31:12.030 --> 00:31:13.820
I was too desperate.

00:31:14.960 --> 00:31:16.860
About what they did afterward,

00:31:17.030 --> 00:31:18.760
I really know nothing about it.

00:31:19.110 --> 00:31:19.510
Captain Qin,

00:31:19.510 --> 00:31:21.510
I really should've listened to you.

00:31:22.000 --> 00:31:23.580
I got on the wrong boat.

00:31:24.510 --> 00:31:26.460
It's all my fault.

00:31:26.550 --> 00:31:29.010
I shouldn't have gambled
in the first place!

00:31:30.070 --> 00:31:30.830
So,

00:31:31.960 --> 00:31:33.690
you cooperated with Liu Tianye

00:31:34.160 --> 00:31:36.200
just to get some money

00:31:36.350 --> 00:31:37.480
to pay off your debts,

00:31:37.480 --> 00:31:38.070
right?

00:31:38.200 --> 00:31:38.880
Yes.

00:31:39.880 --> 00:31:40.440
Fine.

00:31:42.550 --> 00:31:43.490
I'm done here.

00:31:43.680 --> 00:31:44.750
This old cunning fox

00:31:44.750 --> 00:31:47.010
must've rehearsed it many times at home.

00:31:47.270 --> 00:31:48.640
I have no more questions.

00:31:48.640 --> 00:31:50.410
Make a note about
how he scammed Liu Tianye.

00:31:50.410 --> 00:31:51.350
I've written it down.

00:31:51.350 --> 00:31:51.940
Okay.

00:31:53.160 --> 00:31:54.510
Take your time to reflect.

00:31:54.510 --> 00:31:55.960
I'm done talking with you.

00:31:55.960 --> 00:31:56.690
Captain Qin.

00:31:56.910 --> 00:31:58.910
Captain Qin, I'm telling the truth.

00:31:59.830 --> 00:32:01.830
Captain Qin, I'm telling the truth!

00:32:03.700 --> 00:32:04.430
Officer.

00:32:07.720 --> 00:32:09.550
Indeed, there's been some tension

00:32:09.550 --> 00:32:11.750
between my brother Gang and Su Hongbao.

00:32:12.730 --> 00:32:15.090
But I don't know the details.

00:32:15.570 --> 00:32:17.990
Plus, why would he have a gun?

00:32:20.640 --> 00:32:22.900
At the company, we each have

00:32:24.530 --> 00:32:26.490
separate responsibilities.

00:32:28.110 --> 00:32:29.570
On the day of the incident,

00:32:30.030 --> 00:32:32.330
I was at an auction bidding on

00:32:33.240 --> 00:32:35.180
a plum vase from the late Song dynasty.

00:32:35.180 --> 00:32:36.240
I won the bid.

00:32:36.590 --> 00:32:39.050
There should be records.
You can check them.

00:32:40.510 --> 00:32:41.820
My brother

00:32:42.640 --> 00:32:44.240
is an impulsive person.

00:32:44.350 --> 00:32:45.110
I often tell him

00:32:45.110 --> 00:32:47.270
not to hang around
with those shady people,

00:32:47.270 --> 00:32:48.200
not to associate with them,

00:32:48.200 --> 00:32:49.800
but he wouldn't listen to me.

00:32:51.000 --> 00:32:51.910
If

00:32:53.110 --> 00:32:54.310
he contacts me,

00:32:54.310 --> 00:32:56.350
I'll definitely persuade him
to turn himself in.

00:32:56.350 --> 00:32:58.280
Does he have another phone number?

00:32:58.680 --> 00:32:59.270
Yes.

00:33:00.110 --> 00:33:02.030
I sent him a message this morning.

00:33:02.790 --> 00:33:04.370
You can check my phone.

00:33:04.440 --> 00:33:05.440
There's a record.

00:33:11.880 --> 00:33:12.330
Alright,

00:33:12.330 --> 00:33:13.960
thanks for your cooperation.

00:33:13.960 --> 00:33:15.030
If you have any news about him,

00:33:15.030 --> 00:33:16.630
please tell us immediately.

00:33:16.680 --> 00:33:17.290
Of course.

00:33:20.240 --> 00:33:21.030
Are you two

00:33:21.030 --> 00:33:23.360
working with Zhang Xin from Xinrui Group?

00:33:27.590 --> 00:33:28.440
Zhang Xin?

00:33:30.250 --> 00:33:32.160
That name sounds so familiar.

00:33:34.350 --> 00:33:35.950
But I don't know this person.

00:33:36.590 --> 00:33:39.250
Maybe Gang has something to do
with this person.

00:33:40.070 --> 00:33:41.800
Mr. He, you're indeed
a well-read and cultured man.

00:33:41.800 --> 00:33:45.200
You know the concept
of cutting off one's arm to save the body.

00:33:46.790 --> 00:33:48.250
I don't quite understand.

00:33:51.070 --> 00:33:52.970
What your brother did is illegal.

00:33:53.400 --> 00:33:54.320
We hope

00:33:54.680 --> 00:33:56.410
you can learn from his mistake.

00:33:59.830 --> 00:34:00.350
Okay.

00:34:02.710 --> 00:34:05.880
[Deyue Seafood Restaurant]

00:34:05.880 --> 00:34:07.110
The main dish is here.

00:34:09.380 --> 00:34:11.440
Braised pork knuckles with oysters.

00:34:13.030 --> 00:34:14.030
It's a great dish.

00:34:15.070 --> 00:34:16.469
It conveys good meaning.

00:34:17.360 --> 00:34:18.000
Oysters

00:34:18.800 --> 00:34:20.000
mean "good fortune".

00:34:20.400 --> 00:34:21.400
And pork knuckles

00:34:21.920 --> 00:34:22.670
mean "in hands".

00:34:22.670 --> 00:34:23.230
Right?

00:34:23.230 --> 00:34:24.480
Well, Ms. Zhou's blessings

00:34:24.480 --> 00:34:25.550
are as beautiful as she is.

00:34:25.550 --> 00:34:27.949
She's wishing us
good fortune in our hands,

00:34:28.030 --> 00:34:28.630
right?

00:34:28.630 --> 00:34:29.190
Ms. Zhou,

00:34:29.800 --> 00:34:30.800
I'll toast to you.

00:34:35.110 --> 00:34:36.840
I'll skip the drinks. You guys go ahead.

00:34:36.840 --> 00:34:38.639
I have other guests to attend to.

00:34:39.000 --> 00:34:39.980
Okay, go ahead.

00:34:45.320 --> 00:34:46.489
This is awesome.

00:34:47.070 --> 00:34:48.100
From now on,

00:34:48.440 --> 00:34:50.040
Hanzhou will be ours to take.

00:34:50.710 --> 00:34:52.340
As for Ma Jin

00:34:52.630 --> 00:34:53.659
and He Biao,

00:34:54.150 --> 00:34:56.159
they have to step aside.

00:34:56.800 --> 00:34:57.480
Right?

00:34:58.550 --> 00:34:59.610
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

00:35:00.440 --> 00:35:02.120
I heard from the hospital

00:35:02.760 --> 00:35:04.190
that Su didn't make it.

00:35:07.760 --> 00:35:08.620
It's good news.

00:35:08.800 --> 00:35:09.740
Now we're clean.

00:35:10.440 --> 00:35:11.070
It proves

00:35:11.150 --> 00:35:13.140
we made the right choice

00:35:13.510 --> 00:35:14.640
with this firewall.

00:35:15.110 --> 00:35:16.110
I'll make a toast.

00:35:16.710 --> 00:35:17.350
To Su.

00:35:18.960 --> 00:35:19.400
To Su.

00:35:20.280 --> 00:35:20.760
Come on.

00:35:25.670 --> 00:35:26.240
Tianye.

00:35:27.440 --> 00:35:28.440
How's it going

00:35:28.440 --> 00:35:29.170
with He Biao?

00:35:29.550 --> 00:35:30.550
We can talk to him.

00:35:33.000 --> 00:35:34.320
However, now that Su is gone,

00:35:34.320 --> 00:35:35.850
we need to find Lin quickly.

00:35:37.280 --> 00:35:37.880
Got it.

00:35:49.150 --> 00:35:49.840
Mr. He,

00:35:50.960 --> 00:35:53.490
I heard that you just left
the police station.

00:35:53.590 --> 00:35:54.720
Is everything okay?

00:35:55.070 --> 00:35:56.170
Thank you, Tianye.

00:35:57.150 --> 00:35:59.210
The talk with your brother went well.

00:36:00.470 --> 00:36:01.990
He still doesn't know

00:36:02.710 --> 00:36:05.160
who made Qiao Defu turn himself in.

00:36:05.510 --> 00:36:06.710
You can rest assured.

00:36:06.880 --> 00:36:07.660
Qiao Defu

00:36:08.190 --> 00:36:09.390
won't sell you out.

00:36:09.920 --> 00:36:10.790
Well, maybe

00:36:11.920 --> 00:36:13.320
we should call a truce.

00:36:14.760 --> 00:36:15.530
Su is dead.

00:36:16.280 --> 00:36:17.070
And your brother

00:36:17.070 --> 00:36:18.800
can't stay in Hanzhou anymore.

00:36:19.550 --> 00:36:21.010
If you need help,

00:36:21.110 --> 00:36:22.450
I can send Gang out.

00:36:22.840 --> 00:36:24.630
You'll go back to your Grand Paradise,

00:36:24.630 --> 00:36:26.630
and I'll continue
my construction business.

00:36:26.630 --> 00:36:27.630
What do you think?

00:36:28.470 --> 00:36:29.600
I see.

00:36:30.800 --> 00:36:32.260
You want me to

00:36:33.110 --> 00:36:35.480
sacrifice a piece and admit defeat, right?

00:36:35.480 --> 00:36:36.510
Tianye.

00:36:37.550 --> 00:36:39.350
Even if a pawn crosses the river,

00:36:39.590 --> 00:36:41.190
it still can't become a rook.

00:36:42.190 --> 00:36:44.520
You don't know who'll have the last laugh.

00:36:46.320 --> 00:36:47.260
Think about it.

00:36:47.840 --> 00:36:48.840
No need.

00:36:49.190 --> 00:36:50.960
Wish you and Ms. Zhang

00:36:50.960 --> 00:36:52.490
a successful cooperation.

00:36:52.880 --> 00:36:53.670
In a few days,

00:36:54.320 --> 00:36:55.650
I'll send you a big gift.

00:37:19.360 --> 00:37:19.910
Gang,

00:37:21.360 --> 00:37:22.530
how's your injury?

00:37:24.030 --> 00:37:24.510
Muzhi.

00:37:25.510 --> 00:37:27.190
I'm fine. Everything's fine.

00:37:27.190 --> 00:37:28.070
Don't worry.

00:37:33.590 --> 00:37:35.120
Don't come over these days.

00:37:37.320 --> 00:37:38.420
Wait for a while.

00:37:39.360 --> 00:37:41.220
The police might be watching you.

00:37:41.670 --> 00:37:42.600
Just be careful.

00:37:43.920 --> 00:37:45.120
Thanks, Young Mr. He.

00:37:55.030 --> 00:37:55.560
Muzhi,

00:37:56.920 --> 00:37:57.760
today...

00:37:59.750 --> 00:38:01.280
How's the weather outside?

00:38:02.480 --> 00:38:03.610
The weather outside

00:38:04.710 --> 00:38:05.440
is not great.

00:38:07.630 --> 00:38:09.440
Liu Tianye called me.

00:38:09.920 --> 00:38:11.050
He wants to talk.

00:38:11.710 --> 00:38:12.320
Muzhi.

00:38:13.400 --> 00:38:14.650
It was my fault.

00:38:15.510 --> 00:38:17.000
I messed it up.

00:38:17.440 --> 00:38:19.640
I fell into their trap. I deserved this.

00:38:21.510 --> 00:38:21.960
Muzhi.

00:38:23.230 --> 00:38:24.540
Just leave me alone.

00:38:26.110 --> 00:38:27.970
Don't hold a grudge against them.

00:38:28.760 --> 00:38:30.840
I don't want to drag you down anymore.

00:38:31.920 --> 00:38:33.980
Now that they've reached out,

00:38:35.800 --> 00:38:37.490
just talk to them.

00:38:38.000 --> 00:38:38.740
Gang.

00:38:40.630 --> 00:38:42.230
I have nothing to say to them.

00:38:44.150 --> 00:38:45.650
I'm not holding a grudge

00:38:47.660 --> 00:38:49.510
but holding the stakes of our lives.